{"card":{"card_id":"ma-c-32b35dbbc29a7158ba8d","statement":"On $V_l\\ot V_m$, we have\n\n\\begin{align}\n&b_if_{i-1}f_{i+1}\\wb^{(\\lb,\\mb)}_{\\jb} \\nonumber\\\\\n&=A_1\\wb^{(\\lb-\\eb_s+\\eb_{s+1},\\mb)}_{\\jb+\\eb_{s+1}}\n+B_1f_{i+1}\\wb^{(\\lb-\\eb_s+\\eb_{s+1},\\mb)}_{\\jb}\n+C_1f_{i-1}\\wb^{(\\lb-\\eb_s+\\eb_{s+1},\\mb)}_{\\jb-\\eb_s+\\eb_{s+1}}\n+D_1f_{i-1}f_{i+1}\\wb^{(\\lb-\\eb_s+\\eb_{s+1},\\mb)}_{\\jb-\\eb_s} \\nonumber\\\\\n&+A_2\\wb^{(\\lb,\\mb-\\eb_s+\\eb_{s+1})}_{\\jb+\\eb_{s+1}}\n+B_2f_{i+1}\\wb^{(\\lb,\\mb-\\eb_s+\\eb_{s+1})}_{\\jb}\n+C_2f_{i-1}\\wb^{(\\lb,\\mb-\\eb_s+\\eb_{s+1})}_{\\jb-\\eb_s+\\eb_{s+1}}\n+D_2f_{i-1}f_{i+1}\\wb^{(\\lb,\\mb-\\eb_s+\\eb_{s+1})}_{\\jb-\\eb_s} \\nonumber\\\\\n&+A_3\\wb^{(\\lb+\\eb_s-\\eb_{s+1},\\mb)}_{\\jb+\\eb_s}\n+B_3f_{i+1}\\wb^{(\\lb+\\eb_s-\\eb_{s+1},\\mb)}_{\\jb+\\eb_s-\\eb_{s+1}}\n+C_3f_{i-1}\\wb^{(\\lb+\\eb_s-\\eb_{s+1},\\mb)}_{\\jb}\n+D_3f_{i-1}f_{i+1}\\wb^{(\\lb+\\eb_s-\\eb_{s+1},\\mb)}_{\\jb-\\eb_{s+1}} \\nonumber\\\\\n&+A_4\\wb^{(\\lb,\\mb+\\eb_s-\\eb_{s+1})}_{\\jb+\\eb_s}\n+B_4f_{i+1}\\wb^{(\\lb,\\mb+\\eb_s-\\eb_{s+1})}_{\\jb+\\eb_s-\\eb_{s+1}}\n+C_4f_{i-1}\\wb^{(\\lb,\\mb+\\eb_s-\\eb_{s+1})}_{\\jb}\n+D_4f_{i-1}f_{i+1}\\wb^{(\\lb,\\mb+\\eb_s-\\eb_{s+1})}_{\\jb-\\eb_{s+1}},\n\\end{align}\n\nwhere\n\n\\begin{align*}\nA_1&=q^{j_s+j_{s+1}-l_{s+1}-m_s-1}\\frac{[l_s-j_s][m_{s+1}-j_{s+1}][l_s+m_s-j_s+1]}\n{[l_s+m_s-2j_s+1][l_{s+1}+m_{s+1}-2j_{s+1}+1]}\\\\\nA_2&=-\\frac{[l_{s+1}-j_{s+1}][m_s-j_s][l_s+m_s-j_s+1]}\n{[l_s+m_s-2j_s+1][l_{s+1}+m_{s+1}-2j_{s+1}+1]}\\\\\nA_3&=q^{j_s+j_{s+1}-l_s-m_s-1}\n\\frac{[l_{s+1}-j_{s+1}][m_s-j_s][l_{s+1}+m_{s+1}-j_{s+1}+1]}\n{[l_s+m_s-2j_s+1][l_{s+1}+m_{s+1}-2j_{s+1}+1]}\\\\\nA_4&=-q^{2j_s+2j_{s+1}-l_s-l_{s+1}-2m_s-2}\n\\frac{[l_s-j_s][m_{s+1}-j_{s+1}][l_{s+1}+m_{s+1}-j_{s+1}+1]}\n{[l_s+m_s-2j_s+1][l_{s+1}+m_{s+1}-2j_{s+1}+1]},\n\\end{align*}\n\n\\begin{align*}\nB_j&=B'_j\\frac{[l_s+m_s-j_s+1][l_{s+1}+m_{s+1}-2j_{s+1}]}{[l_s+m_s-2j_s+1][l_{s+1}+m_{s+1}-2j_{s+1}+1]}\\quad(j=1,2),\\\\\n&=B'_j\\frac{[j_{s+1}][l_{s+1}+m_{s+1}-2j_{s+1}]}{[l_s+m_s-2j_s+1][l_{s+1}+m_{s+1}-2j_{s+1}+1]}\\quad(j=3,4),\\\\\nC_j&=C'_j\\frac{[j_s][l_s+m_s-2j_s]}{[l_s+m_s-2j_s+1][l_{s+1}+m_{s+1}-2j_{s+1}+1]}\\quad(j=1,2),\\\\\n&=C'_j\\frac{[l_s+m_s-2j_s][l_{s+1}+m_{s+1}-j_{s+1}+1]}{[l_s+m_s-2j_s+1][l_{s+1}+m_{s+1}-2j_{s+1}+1]}\\quad(j=3,4),\\\\\nD_j&=D'_j\\frac{[l_s+m_s-2j_s][l_{s+1}+m_{s+1}-2j_{s+1}]}{[l_s+m_s-2j_s+1][l_{s+1}+m_{s+1}-2j_{s+1}+1]}\\quad(j=1,2,3,4).\n\\end{align*}","source_id":"arXiv:2012.00967","cluster":"mathematics","statement_sha256":"2df53b0ac803195d7e6bc4662c1376074a25a3a4abfb2f9d94b3b90be84ddad0","kind":"proposition","label":"Proposition 11","ref_key":"prop:bffw","name":"","order":16,"deps":[],"cite_keys":[],"provenance":{"source_url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2012.00967","harvest_mode":"arxiv_eprint","payload_sha256":"d1adc339d796c1ac2f8b9eb47b789e0355426463b407ef73101192b096da360b","line":611,"origin":"latex_env","retrieved_at":"2026-09-26T14:00:38+08:00"},"wash":{"version":"cardwash.v2","stages":["segment","purify","classify","dedupe","emit"],"numbering":"document_order_with_label_heuristic","detail":{"stripped_proof":false,"chars":2212,"math_hints":296}}},"paper":{"source_id":"arXiv:2012.00967","title":"Solution to the reflection equation related to the $\\iota$quantum group of type AII","abstract":"A solution to the reflection equation associated to a coideal subalgebra of $U_q(A_{2n-1}^{(1)})$ of type AII in the symmetric tensor representations is presented. If parameters of the coideal subalgebra are suitably chosen, the $K$ matrix does not depend on the quantum parameter $q$ and still agrees with a solution in arXiv:nlin/0411044 at $q=0$.","authors":["Hiroto Kusano","Masato Okado"],"year":"2020","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2012.00967","cluster":"mathematics","macros":{"Q":"{\\mathbb Q}","Z":"{\\mathbb Z}","eb":"\\boldsymbol{e}","jb":"\\boldsymbol{j}","lb":"\\boldsymbol{l}","mb":"\\boldsymbol{m}","ob":"\\boldsymbol{o}","ot":"\\otimes","pair":"\